ssfully:'Deleted successfully',confirmationDescriptionSaveDataToServer:'Do you want to save data to server?',alertTitleUnsavedDataLiveTracking:'Unsaved Data',alertDescriptionUnsavedDataLiveTracking:'This data is not saved to the server yet. Do you want to save it?',deletedSuccesfully:'Deleted successfully',uploadedSuccesfully:'Uploaded successfully',confirmReportIssueTitle:'Report Bug',confirmReportIssueDescription:'This action will bring you to share a file JSON containing your running data. Do you want to continue?',deleting:'Deleting',notEnoughDataTitle:'Not enough data',notEnoughDataDescription:'The statistics may not represent the actual conditions',alertSuccessCopyImageTitle:'Image copied successfully',alertSuccessCopyImageDescription:'You can paste it into another application, but please note that <bold>not all apps</bold> support pasting images directly from the clipboard. <bold>Alternatively</bold>, you can use the Download feature to save the image to your gallery.',alertLocationNotDetectedTitle:'Unable to Detect Location',alertLocationNotDetectedDescription:'Unable to retrieve your location. Please ensure your device\u2019s location settings or try again.'},chooseOne:'Choose one',stepTitle:{Citizen:'Citizen',UploadID:'Upload ID',Profile:'Profile'},uploadPhotoOptions:{openCamera:'Open Camera',chooseFromGallery:'Choose From Gallery'},error:{failed:'Failed',failedToRegister:'Failed to register',failedToLogin:'Failed to login',failedToSendOTP:'Failed to send otp',failedToGetProfile:'Failed to get profile',failedToSaveProfile:'Failed to save profile',failedToDeleteAccount:'Failed to delete account',failedToConfirmProfile:'Failed confirm profile',profileIsNotComplete:'Your profile is not complete',profileIsNotCompleteDescription:'Please complete your profile to continue',failedToGetEvents:'Failed to get events',failedToGetEvent:'Failed to get event',failedToGetTransactions:'Failed to get transactions',failedToGetTransaction:'Failed to get transaction',failedToApplyCoupon:'Failed to Apply Coupon',failedToPayNow:'Failed to pay now',invalidPayment:'Invalid Payment',failedToRegisterEvent:'Failed to register event',failedToBuyAddOns:'Failed to buy add ons',failedToDelegate:'Failed to delegate',failedToGenerateQR:'Failed to generate QR Code',failedToUpload:'Failed to upload',sslConnectionFailed:'Secure connection (SSL) failed. Please try again later.',failedToGetInvitations:'Failed to get invitations',cannotRegisterEvent:'Cannot register event',categoryPricingNotFound:'Category & pricing not exist for now',failedToGetCookies:'Failed to get cookies',failedToGetCookiesDesc:"We can't get the cookies, please try again later.",Field:'Field',isRequired:'is required',failedToGetPartners:'Failed to get partners',invalidID:'Invalid ID',pleaseRecheckYourID:'Please check your ID and try again',tryAgainLater:'Please try again later',jerseySizeChartNotFound:'Jersey Size chart not found',noOtherPaymentMethodAvailable:'Other payment method is not available.',noPaymentMethodAvailable:'Payment method is not available.',phoneNumberNotValid:'Phone number is not valid',paymentUrlNotAvailable:'Payment url not available',messagePowerSaveModeActive:'Your device is currently in power save mode. Location tracking may be delayed or not work in real-time to conserve battery.',messageUpnormal:"We haven't detected any movement. This might be because you haven't started moving yet or your GPS isn't working properly. If you've moved more than 1 meter but data isn't showing, please check your device's location settings and try again.",liveTrackingRequiredLoginTitle:'Login to continue',liveTrackingRequiredLoginDescription:'Please login to access this feature.',failedToUploadDataLiveTracking:'Failed to upload data',alertTitleFailedToUploadDataLiveTracking:'Failed to upload data',alertDescriptionFailedToUploadDataLiveTracking:'Your data is saved locally. You can try to upload it again later.'},aboutUsContent:{title_1:'DECADE OF LEGACY',description_1a:'For the past decade, Borobudur Marathon has been more than a race. It is a journey shaped by every stride, every story, and every person who has been part of it. From a single starting line to thousands of dreams moving forward together, we have created a living legacy built on perseverance, connection, and a deep appreciation for culture. Decade of Legacy is not only a celebration of ten remarkable years, but a tribute to everyone who has made this journey possible because a legacy is never built in a single day; it is created, step by step, together.',description_1b:'Borobudur Marathon 2025 Powered by Bank Jateng once again welcomes runners to unite and voice the spirit with the people of Magelang. This year, let us inspire one another through the voice of unity.',title_2:'DASA WARSA WARISAN',description_2a:'This year is a witness that we all can overcome adversity. This struggle is strongly intertwined with each other\u2019s passion in inspiring one another.',description_2b:'Dasa Warsa Warisan embodies ten years of collective journeys that have transformed every step into a lasting legacy. Rooted in the spirit of togetherness, it honors the people, stories, and traditions that have defined Borobudur Marathon, while inspiring new generations to carry its legacy forward.'},idProcessing:{title1:'Processing...',description1:'Your ID still in processing to validate.',title2:'We still check your ID',description2:'Please wait... Your ID still in processing to validate.',title3:'Please wait...',description3:'We still processing to validate.',title:'We still check your ID',description:'Your ID still in processing to validate.'},invitation:{list:'Invited Events',used:'Registered',invited:'Invited',expired:'Expired Invitation'},trouble:{forgotPassword:'Forgot Password',verifyEmail:'Verify Email'},delegate:{buttonText:'Delegate My Race Pack',boxTitle:'Delegate Race Pack',boxTitleDescripton:'You can entrust your attributes to other people',title:'Delegate Person Data',subTitle:'Enter a