 New Route',edit:'Edit Route',delete:'Delete Route',useRoute:'Use This Route',deleteRoute:'Are you sure to remove this route?'},runningPermission:{disableBatteryOptimizationInstruction:'Please disable battery optimization'},infoLocalData:{message:'This feature is still in the testing phase. Data processing is only carried out in the local database.'},infoRunningInvalidData:{message:'Click to show incomplete data.'},infoForBackToOKData:{message:'Back to my running data.'},AlertInfoForInvalidLocalDatabase:{message:'This page displays run data that failed to be sent to the server, but is stored in the local database. If you uninstall the app, this data will be lost.'},AlertInfoForInvalidLocalStorage:{message:'This page displays run data that failed to be sent to the server, but is stored in the local storage. If you uninstall the app, this data will be lost.'},saveDataToServer:{title:'Save data to server'},pageRaceResult:{menu:'Race Results',title:'Borobudur Marathon Race Results',subtitle:'Track race rankings and see how you stack up against other participants in Borobudur Marathon Events'},connection:{disconnected:'Disconnected. Please check your connection.',slow:'Slow connection detected. Please check your network and try again.'},pageGallery:{menu:'Galleries',title:'Borobudur Marathon Galleries',description:'Gallery from all Borobudur Marathon events'},pageThingsToDo:{menu:'Things to do',title:'Things to do',description:'Coming Soon! \ud83d\ude80 This feature will be available soon. Stay tuned!'},pageComingSoon:{description:'Coming Soon! \ud83d\ude80 This feature will be available soon. Stay tuned!'},pagePermissionLocation:{title:'Use Your Location',description:'My Borobudur Marathon app requires your precise location for activity recording, travelled distance calculation, live running tracking, and runner safety, even when the app is closed or not in use.'},pagePermissionLocationRegular:{title:'Use Your Location',description:'My Borobudur Marathon app requires your precise location for activity recording, travelled distance calculation, live running tracking, and runner safety.'},pagePermissionActiveInBackground:{title:'Keep App Running in The Background',description:'Allow the Borobudur Marathon application to always run in the background so that we always get your active activity even if you leave the application'},backgroundPermissionRationale:{title:"Allow My Borobudur Marathon to access this device's location even when closed or not in use ?",message:"This app collects location data for activity recording, travelled distance calculation, live running tracking, and runner safety, even when the app is closed or not in use.",positiveAction:"Change to \"Allow all the time\"",negativeAction:"Cancel"},pageDisableBatteryOptimization:{title:'Disable Battery Optimization',description:'Disable battery optimization so that the live tracking feature can function more optimally.'},pageDisableLowPowerMode:{title:'Low Power Mode',description:'Some features may not work optimally when "Battery Saver" / "Low Power Mode" is on. Want to open settings?'},pageBatterySaverTutorial:{title:'Steps to Disable Battery Optimization',tutorialTextAndroid:{first:{title:'Open battery settings',content:'Open the system settings on your device, then select the Battery settings.'},second:{title:'Find Battery Optimization',content:'Find the option "High Background power consumption" or "Battery Optimization" in the battery settings.'},third:{title:'My Borobudur Marathon',content:'Find your app in the provided list, then "enable high battery consumption" or "disable battery optimization".'}},note:{title:'Note',firstDesc:'If your settings looks different you can visit',secondDesc:'then find your handphone brand and follow the instruction that have been provided',thisLink:'this link'},buttonText:'Go To Setting'},allow:'Allow',openSetting:'Open Setting',webViewLoadingTooLongMessage:'Waiting too long? Try opening it in your browser.',webViewOpenInBrowser:'Ope